      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi folks, appreciate your patience with this one. \n\nYou may have noticed but we pushed a new patch out late yesterday which should contain the fix previously discussed in this thread - To be clear, the fix disables the screen space canvas toggling while in VR.\n\nI've tested @{6027f6b07cebda54479ffcff|full_name}'s VR Dancing world and as far as I can tell the issue is now resolved.\n\n@{6027f6b07cebda54479ffcff|full_name}, if you could please test on your end and confirm that'd be much appreciated.\n\n@{5ff604ed2c785d095dafaae7|full_name}, if you could also test that'd be useful.\n\nThanks again for providing all the info we needed to get this resolved, it's been extremely helpful and helped us get this sorted without much delay.",
